# TypeScript incremental build state. Must never be committed: tsc trusts it to
# decide what is already emitted, so a stale one checked out in CI makes the build
# skip emitting JavaScript while dist/ is absent, publishing a package with
# declarations and no code.
*.tsbuildinfo
